    "title": "Liverpool confirmed XI vs. PSG: Isak starts, Salah BENCHED",
    "text": "Alexander Isak starts his first game of 2026 in a surprising Liverpool lineup vs. Paris Saint-Germain, with Arne Slot again naming Mo Salah on the bench. Liverpool vs. PSG: Team News Changes: 5 (IN: Kerkez, Mac Allister, Gravenberch, Ekitike, Isak | OUT: Robertson, Jones, Ngumoha, Salah, Gakpo) Formation: 4-2-2-2 Average XI Age: 25.3 Slot has now left Salah out of the starting lineup for both legs of Liverpool’s Champions League quarter-final against PSG.Report Ad Giorgi Mamardashvili is one of six players to keep his place from Saturday’s 2-0 win over Fulham. He starts behind a back four of Jeremie Frimpong, Ibrahima Konate, captain Virgil van Dijk and the returning Milos Kerkez. Ryan Gravenberch and Alexis Mac Allister are restored as the deeper-lying midfielders with Liverpool expected to line up in a 4-2-2-2. That means Dominik Szoboszlai and Florian Wirtz will operate further forward with Isak partnering Hugo Ekitike up front. Report Ad Liverpool could also remain in their usual 4-2-3-1 setup with Ekitike on the left and Isak as lone striker, with PSG manager Luis Enrique left guessing. Salah joins a strong bench along with the likes of Andy Robertson, Curtis Jones, Rio Ngumoha and Cody Gakpo. There are no changes to the PSG XI that thumped Liverpool 2-0 in Paris last week, with a fully rested side boosted by the return of Bradley Barcola to the bench. Liverpool: Mamardashvili; Frimpong, Konate, Van Dijk, Kerkez; Gravenberch, Mac Allister; Szoboszlai, Wirtz; Isak, Ekitike Substitutes: Woodman, Misciur, Gomez, Nallo, Robertson, Jones, Nyoni, Salah, Gakpo, Ngumoha, Chiesa PSG: Safonov; Hakimi, Marquinhos, Pacho, Mendes; Neves, Vitinha, Zaire-Emery; Kvaratskhelia, Dembele, Doue Substitutes: Chevalier, Marin, Beraldo, Zabarnyi, Hernandez, Mayulu, Lee, Barcola, Mbaye, Fernandez, Ramos Report Ad PSG vs. Liverpool: TV Info Subscribe to This Is Anfield on YouTube Join over 370,000 subscribers to get the latest LFC videos to your feed How to Watch Liverpool vs. PSG in the UK Liverpool vs. PSG is being shown live on Amazon Prime in the UK, which is available to live stream with Prime here. Live audio commentary of Liverpool vs. PSG and a full match replay and highlights will also be available on All Red Video here. This Is Anfield will also be providing live text commentary throughout on our website and full match reaction and analysis on the This Is Anfield app for iPhone and Android later. Download free here.",
